# This app has no required environment variables.
#
# The optional live-synthesis integration (OpenRouter) is bring-your-own-key:
# each visitor pastes their own key into the in-app Settings panel on the
# Simulation page, and it is stored only in that browser's localStorage —
# it is never read from, or written to, a .env file, and this app has no
# backend to hold a server-side key in the first place.
#
# This file exists to make that explicit for anyone auditing the repo
# before deploying it.
